  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "the preliminary cause of the inability of 1-SV-1B-4 and 1-SV-2B-4 to lift was corrosion bonding...The outlet elbow and tailpipe drain pan drains were clogged for an extended period of time for the failed valves, which prevented condensed seat leakage draining from the valves when seat leakage occurred. This resulted in the valve bodies periodically filling with water and corroding at a faster rate than would be expected",
